{title: Jeene Mein Aye Maza}
{artist: Ankur Tewari Gully Boy}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Tarazu ke bas do thaal [A]hain,        [Dm]Ek ore hum dooje mein khwaab [A]hain
[D]Zindagi yeh [Gm]pareshaan hai,        [A#]Ganimat hai tu hai [A]yahan
Jeene mein aaye [Dm]maza,        [Dm]Khareeda nahi jaata khwaab [A]hai
[Dm]Kiraya bhi aisa lajawab [A]hai,        [D]Zindagi yeh [Gm]pareshaan hai
[A#]Ganimat hai tu hai [A]yahan,        Jeene mein aaye [Dm]maza
[D]Tu jo mila jaaga [Gm]khwaab hai,        [C]Khoyi huyi meri [F]kitaab hai
[A#]Muskaya sa [C]aadaab hai,        [A]Jeene mein aaye [Dm]maza
[Dm]Sustaye mausam aabaad [A]hain,        [Dm]Hawaon ke rukh humse naaraaz [A]hain
[D]Zindagi yeh [Gm]pareshaan hai,        [A#]Ganimat hai tu hai [A]yahan
Jeene mein aaye [Dm]maza,        [D]Tu jo mila chhida [Gm]saaz hai
[C]Khamoshi ko mili [F]aawaaz hai,        [A#]Behti hawa sa [C]ehsaas hai
[A]Jeene mein aaye [Dm]maza,        [Dm]Bigda hua hisaab [A]hai
[Dm]Thoda nafa thoda nuksaan [A]hai,        [D]Zindagi yeh [Gm]pareshaan hai
